sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Research Scientist
    participant Pipeline as Multi-Stage Pipeline
    participant Store as HDF5 Store
    participant AV as Analytical Vetting
    participant MR as Morales-Ramis Validator
    participant MC as Monte Carlo Validator

    User->>Pipeline: validate_candidate(integral, tier=2)
    Note over User,Pipeline: Begin 3-stage validation gauntlet

    Pipeline->>Store: load_trajectories(tier=2, count=100)
    Store-->>Pipeline: trajectories[100]

    Note over Pipeline,AV: Stage 1: Analytical Vetting (WP4.1)
    Pipeline->>AV: validate(integral, trajectories)
    AV->>AV: Check {I, H} = 0 (conservation)
    AV->>AV: Check {I, J} = 0 (involution)
    AV->>AV: Check rank(Jacobian) = n (independence)

    alt Conservation test fails
        AV-->>Pipeline: {passed: false, reason: "conservation_violation", error: 1.2e-8}
        Pipeline-->>User: REJECTED - Stage 1 failed
    else All analytical tests pass
        AV-->>Pipeline: {passed: true, conservation_error: 1.2e-14}

        Note over Pipeline,MR: Stage 2: Morales-Ramis Test (WP4.2)
        Pipeline->>MR: test_integrability(integral, periodic_orbit)
        MR->>MR: Compute Normal Variational Equations (NVE)
        MR->>MR: Apply Kovacic algorithm
        MR->>MR: Determine Differential Galois group

        alt Phase I: Galois group abelian (downstairs)
            MR-->>Pipeline: {phase1_passed: true, warning: "Unexpected - should be non-abelian"}
            Note right of MR: Classical non-integrability<br/>not confirmed
        else Phase I: Galois group non-abelian (expected)
            MR->>MR: Phase II: Test upstairs (lifted space)

            alt Phase II: Galois group non-abelian (upstairs)
                MR-->>Pipeline: {passed: false, upstairs_group: "S4"}
                Pipeline-->>User: REJECTED - Non-integrable in lifted space
            else Phase II: Galois group abelian (upstairs)
                MR-->>Pipeline: {passed: true, downstairs_group: "S_n", upstairs_group: "Z/2Z"}

                Note over Pipeline,MC: Stage 3: Monte Carlo Validation (WP4.3)
                Pipeline->>MC: statistical_validation(integral, samples=10000)
                MC->>Store: load_random_trajectories(10000)
                Store-->>MC: diverse_trajectories[10000]
                MC->>MC: Compute conservation across parameter space
                MC->>MC: Test across mass ratios, energies, eccentricities

                alt Robustness < 95%
                    MC-->>Pipeline: {passed: false, robustness: 87.3%, failures: 1270}
                    Pipeline-->>User: REJECTED - Not robust across parameter space
                else Robustness >= 95%
                    MC-->>Pipeline: {passed: true, robustness: 99.8%, samples: 10000}
                    Pipeline-->>User: VALIDATED ✓ - All stages passed
                end
            end
        end
    end
